            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\frac{5}{6y}$",
              "worked": "The HCF is $2x$. Divide numerator and denominator by $2x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{10x}{12xy}&=\\frac{5}{6y}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 18
          },
          {
            "id": "p27-q2-j",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "j",
            "prompt": "$\\frac{10x}{12xy^{2}}$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\frac{5}{6y^{2}}$",
              "worked": "The HCF is $2x$. Divide numerator and denominator by $2x$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{10x}{12xy^{2}}&=\\frac{5}{6y^{2}}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 18
          },
          {
            "id": "p27-q2-k",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "k",
            "prompt": "$\\frac{10xy}{12xy^{2}}$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\frac{5}{6y}$",
              "worked": "The HCF is $2xy$. Divide numerator and denominator by $2xy$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{10xy}{12xy^{2}}&=\\frac{5}{6y}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 18
          },
          {
            "id": "p27-q2-l",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "l",
            "prompt": "$\\frac{10x^{2}y}{12xy^{2}}$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\frac{5x}{6y}$",
              "worked": "The HCF is $2xy$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{10x^{2}y}{12xy^{2}}&=\\frac{2xy\\cdot5x}{2xy\\cdot6y}\\\\\\frac{10x^{2}y}{12xy^{2}}&=\\frac{5x}{6y}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 18
          },
          {
            "id": "p27-q2-m",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "m",
            "prompt": "$\\frac{10x^{2}y^{2}}{12xy^{2}}$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\frac{5x}{6}$",
              "worked": "The HCF is $2xy^{2}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{10x^{2}y^{2}}{12xy^{2}}&=\\frac{2xy^{2}\\cdot5x}{2xy^{2}\\cdot6}\\\\\\frac{10x^{2}y^{2}}{12xy^{2}}&=\\frac{5x}{6}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 18
          },
          {
            "id": "p27-q2-n",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "n",
            "prompt": "$\\frac{10x^{2}y^{3}}{12xy^{2}}$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\frac{5xy}{6}$",
              "worked": "The HCF is $2xy^{2}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{10x^{2}y^{3}}{12xy^{2}}&=\\frac{2xy^{2}\\cdot5xy}{2xy^{2}\\cdot6}\\\\\\frac{10x^{2}y^{3}}{12xy^{2}}&=\\frac{5xy}{6}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 18
          },
          {
            "id": "p27-q2-o",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "o",
            "prompt": "$\\frac{100x^{2}y^{4}}{120xy^{2}}$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$\\frac{5xy^{2}}{6}$",
              "worked": "The HCF is $20xy^{2}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{100x^{2}y^{4}}{120xy^{2}}&=\\frac{20xy^{2}\\cdot5xy^{2}}{20xy^{2}\\cdot6}\\\\\\frac{100x^{2}y^{4}}{120xy^{2}}&=\\frac{5xy^{2}}{6}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 18
          },
          {
            "id": "p27-q2-p",
            "type": "part",
            "label": "p",
            "prompt": "$\\frac{100x^{2}y^{4}}{xy^{2}}$",
            "layout": "list",
            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$100xy^{2}$",
              "worked": "The HCF is $xy^{2}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{100x^{2}y^{4}}{xy^{2}}&=\\frac{xy^{2}\\cdot100xy^{2}}{xy^{2}\\cdot1}\\\\\\frac{100x^{2}y^{4}}{xy^{2}}&=100xy^{2}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 18
          }
        ]
      }
